The {{Term/Store|Raw Bird Thigh|Raw Bird Thighs|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Upon death, Raw Bird Thighs can be dropped by [[Rainbow Pigeon]]s, [[Hotfeather Pigeon]]s, [[White Pigeon]]s, [[Islander Hawk]]s, and [[Eldin Ostrich]]es. The traveling [[Merchant]] [[Mezer]] sells Raw Bird Thighs near [[Dueling Peaks Stable]]. When eaten, Raw Bird Thighs will heal [[Link]] for one and a half [[Heart]]s. Raw Bird Thighs can be grilled by a [[Fire]] for [[Roasted Bird Thigh]]s and chilled with [[Ice]] to create [[Frozen Bird Thigh]]s.

Raw Bird Thighs are required to make [[Prime Poultry Curry]] and [[Prime Poultry Pilaf]]. Either Raw Bird Thighs or [[Raw Prime Meat]] is needed to make [[Prime Meat Stew]], [[Prime Meat and Rice Bowl]], [[Salt-Grilled Prime Meat]], and [[Prime Meat and Seafood Fry]]. As is the case with all types of [[Meat]], they can also be used to make [[Creamy Meat Soup]], [[Glazed Meat]], a [[Meat and Mushroom Skewer]], [[Meat Pie]], a [[Meat Skewer]], [[Copious Meat Skewers]], [[Meaty Rice Balls]], [[Monster Stew]], [[Pepper Steak]], [[Steamed Meat]], and a [[Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin]].

